    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <tags>music youtube-music player rust slint audio</tags>
    <summary>A native Windows music player with catalogue search, a local library, queue and audio caching.</summary>
    <description>Auricle is a native Windows music player for the YouTube Music catalogue, built with Rust and Slint without Electron or an embedded web view.

  Features include song, album, artist and playlist search with suggestions and previews; local artist follows and saved albums/playlists; right-click artist, album and queue actions; playback controls, queue and autoplay; liked songs and listening history; a size-limited audio cache; and minimize-to-tray support.

  ![Auricle 0.1.4 on Windows](https://californiaalmonds.github.io/auricle/screenshot.png)

  This is an early Windows release. Streaming availability depends on external services and optional add-ons. yt-dlp and ffmpeg are installed at the user's discretion and are not bundled or redistributed. Auricle is not affiliated with YouTube or Google.</description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
